# game/case06.rpy:60
translate japanese press_meiling_1_b012b978:

    # you "How brief was this rest?"
    you "その「少し」とはどれくらいですか？"

# game/case06.rpy:62
translate japanese press_meiling_1_b48d2a9d:

    # meiling "Two hours. For a youkai, that's barely a blink."
    meiling "二時間です。妖怪にとっては瞬きみたいなものです。"

# game/case06.rpy:66
translate japanese press_meiling_2_374cf47c:

    # you "Did you hear anything while you rested?"
    you "休んでいる間、何か聞こえましたか？"

# game/case06.rpy:67
translate japanese press_meiling_2_f252d076:

    # meiling "Birds. The breeze. Someone humming. Ordinary gate sounds."
    meiling "鳥の声。そよ風。誰かの鼻歌。いつもの門の音です。"

# game/case06.rpy:69
translate japanese press_meiling_2_f2256740:

    # eiki "Humming."
    eiki "鼻歌。"

# game/case06.rpy:73
translate japanese press_meiling_3_1147c1f1:

    # you "Never? How can you be so sure?"
    you "「絶対に」？なぜそう言い切れるのですか？"

# game/case06.rpy:75
translate japanese press_meiling_3_afee21f4:

    # meiling "Because I've seen how thieves get in! Write this down."
    meiling "泥棒の入り方を見たことがあるからです！書き留めてください。"

# game/case06.rpy:76
translate japanese press_meiling_3_2c276c8f:

    # meiling "Put it in my testimony. Exactly as I say it."
    meiling "私の証言に加えてください。一字一句そのままで。"

# game/case06.rpy:80
translate japanese press_meiling_4_921f7cc1:

    # you "How many thieves have you actually seen break in?"
    you "実際に侵入するところを見た泥棒は何人ですか？"

# game/case06.rpy:81
translate japanese press_meiling_4_8cb8634d:

    # meiling "One. Marisa. But she was very thorough about it."
    meiling "一人です。魔理沙。でも、それはもう徹底的でした。"

# game/case06.rpy:83
translate japanese press_meiling_4_f5d9c7bb:

    # eiki "One thief, and from her a law for every thief alive."
    eiki "泥棒一人から、世のすべての泥棒の法則を作るとは。"

# game/case06.rpy:94
translate japanese case6_3af4f096:

    # eiki "Order. The Higan Court of Logic is in session."
    eiki "静粛に。彼岸論理法廷を開廷します。"

# game/case06.rpy:96
translate japanese case6_79e913f8:

    # komachi "Back on the bench, boss?"
    komachi "裁判長席に復帰ですか、四季様？"

# game/case06.rpy:97
translate japanese case6_20fb4d4c:

    # eiki "Where I belong. Komachi, the defendant?"
    eiki "本来の場所です。小町、被告人は？"

# game/case06.rpy:98
translate japanese case6_e390f340:

    # komachi "Awake, boss. I checked twice."
    komachi "起きてますよ、四季様。二回確かめました。"

# game/case06.rpy:99
translate japanese case6_9228cb8e:

    # eiki "A first. Bring her in."
    eiki "前代未聞ですね。連れてきなさい。"

# game/case06.rpy:102
translate japanese case6_8fbabe28:

    # meiling "Hong Meiling, gatekeeper of the Scarlet Devil Mansion. I was awake. Mostly."
    meiling "紅魔館の門番、紅美鈴です。起きていました。だいたいは。"

# game/case06.rpy:105
translate japanese case6_0cb71a97:

    # eiki "The charge: napping at the gate while a thief walked off with the mistress's parasol."
    eiki "罪状：門で居眠りをし、その間に泥棒がお嬢様の日傘を持ち去ったこと。"

# game/case06.rpy:108
translate japanese case6_c0829d26:

    # meiling "Nobody gets past my gate. Everyone knows that."
    meiling "私の門を通れる者はいません。誰でも知ってます。"

# game/case06.rpy:112
translate japanese case6_c290c673:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. One example is a story. It is not a rule."
    eiki "見習い判事。一つの例は一つの話にすぎません。法則ではありません。"

# game/case06.rpy:113
translate japanese case6_ee742e20:

    # eiki "Watch for a witness who turns one story into everyone's."
    eiki "一つの話を全員の話にしてしまう証人に注意しなさい。"

# game/case06.rpy:129
translate japanese case6_133293e7:

    # meiling_t "Yesterday at noon I rested my eyes. Briefly. My mind stayed on duty."
    meiling_t "昨日の昼、少しだけ目を休めました。頭は勤務中でした。"

# game/case06.rpy:130
translate japanese case6_810fb915:

    # meiling_t "While I was resting, the mistress's parasol vanished from the hall."
    meiling_t "休んでいる間に、お嬢様の日傘が広間から消えました。"

# game/case06.rpy:131
translate japanese case6_082ce7fe:

    # meiling_t "But the thief didn't come through my gate. Thieves never do."
    meiling_t "でも泥棒は私の門を通っていません。泥棒は絶対に門を通らないんです。"

# game/case06.rpy:135
translate japanese case6_ecebe65b:

    # eiki "Your witness, Junior Judge. Try to keep her awake."
    eiki "証人をどうぞ、見習い判事。寝かせないように。"

# game/case06.rpy:149
translate japanese case6_cross_d0b360e4:

    # eiki "Again. Komachi, nudge the witness."
    eiki "もう一度。小町、証人をつついて。"

# game/case06.rpy:160
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_f69410cc:

    # you "One break-in through one window doesn't tell us how every thief gets in."
    you "一度窓から侵入された例があっても、すべての泥棒の入り方はわかりません。"

# game/case06.rpy:161
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_6c29c608:

    # you "These geta prints come straight through your front gate. Someone walked right past you."
    you "この下駄の跡は正門からまっすぐ続いています。誰かがあなたの目の前を通ったのです。"

# game/case06.rpy:164
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_53a93a4b:

    # meiling "...Tengu sandals. I'd know them anywhere. I usually see them while I'm asleep."
    meiling "……天狗の下駄。見ればわかります。たいてい寝ている時に見かけますから。"

# game/case06.rpy:168
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_800bfca1:

    # eiki "A hasty generalization. One example, stretched into a law."
    eiki "早まった一般化。たった一つの例を、法則にまで引き伸ばすことです。"

# game/case06.rpy:169
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_d8ef543d:

    # eiki "One swallow does not make a summer. One window does not make every thief."
    eiki "燕一羽で夏にはなりません。窓一つで泥棒全員は語れません。"

# game/case06.rpy:176
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_416ad574:

    # eiki "Defendant Hong Meiling. This court finds you..."
    eiki "被告人、紅美鈴。当法廷はあなたを……"

# game/case06.rpy:187
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_749f0955:

    # eiki "Sentence: one week at the gate. Awake. Komachi will check on you."
    eiki "判決：門番を一週間。起きたまま。小町が見回ります。"

# game/case06.rpy:188
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_0add5145:

    # komachi "Me? Boss, I'm the court's leading expert on naps."
    komachi "私がですか？四季様、私はこの法廷きっての昼寝の専門家ですよ。"

# game/case06.rpy:189
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_31efee77:

    # eiki "Exactly. It takes one to know one."
    eiki "だからです。蛇の道は蛇。"

# game/case06.rpy:192
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_a7e8ba32:

    # meiling "And the parasol?"
    meiling "それで、日傘は？"

# game/case06.rpy:195
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_d6d2bac3:

    # eiki "The note is signed \"A.S.\" A certain reporter will be hearing from this court."
    eiki "メモの署名は「A.S.」。とある記者には、当法廷から連絡がいくでしょう。"

# game/case06.rpy:196
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_6063f5e0:

    # eiki "Bailiff."
    eiki "廷吏。"

# game/case06.rpy:197
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_ce8461be:

    # komachi "On it, boss."
    komachi "はいよ、四季様。"

# game/case06.rpy:209
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_1f137532:

    # eiki "Over the wall. Of course."
    eiki "塀を越えて。当然ですね。"

# game/case06.rpy:210
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_478325d5:

    # komachi "Gatekeepers never use gates, boss. Everyone knows that."
    komachi "門番は絶対に門を使わないんですよ、四季様。誰でも知ってます。"

# game/case06.rpy:211
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_12fd63d6:

    # eiki "Komachi, that is exactly the fallacy we just..."
    eiki "小町、それはまさに今の誤謬……"

# game/case06.rpy:212
translate japanese case6_breakthrough_a37b3ced:

    # eiki "Never mind. Court is adjourned."
    eiki "もういいです。閉廷します。"

translate japanese strings:

    # game/case06.rpy:10
    old "Library Window"
    new "図書館の窓"

    # game/case06.rpy:10
    old "Replaced after Marisa's last visit. Locked from the inside. Not a scratch on it."
    new "魔理沙の前回の訪問後に交換済み。内側から施錠。傷一つない。"

    # game/case06.rpy:12
    old "Footprints at the Gate"
    new "門の足跡"

    # game/case06.rpy:12
    old "Tengu geta prints, from the front gate straight to the hall. Muddy. Fresh."
    new "天狗の下駄の跡。正門から広間までまっすぐ。泥つき、新しい。"

    # game/case06.rpy:14
    old "Note on the Parasol Stand"
    new "傘立てのメモ"

    # game/case06.rpy:14
    old "\"Borrowed for a photo shoot. Back soon! —A.S.\""
    new "「撮影のためお借りします。すぐ返します！ ——A.S.」"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "The Window Theory"
    new "窓の法則"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "Yesterday at noon I rested my eyes. Briefly. My mind stayed on duty."
    new "昨日の昼、少しだけ目を休めました。頭は勤務中でした。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "A nap is a confession, not a fallacy. Find where she reasons."
    new "居眠りは自白であって誤謬ではありません。彼女が推論する箇所を探しなさい。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "While I was resting, the mistress's parasol vanished from the hall."
    new "休んでいる間に、お嬢様の日傘が広間から消えました。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "That is simply what happened. Look for where she draws a conclusion."
    new "それは起きたことそのものです。結論を出す箇所を探しなさい。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "But the thief didn't come through my gate. Thieves never do."
    new "でも泥棒は私の門を通っていません。泥棒は絶対に門を通らないんです。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "\"Never\" is a big word. Press her on it before you object."
    new "「絶対に」は大きな言葉です。異議の前に「待った」で問いただしなさい。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "Marisa broke in through the library window. So every thief uses the windows!"
    new "魔理沙は図書館の窓から侵入しました。だから泥棒はみんな窓を使うんです！"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "She isn't saying one event caused another. She's building a rule out of one example."
    new "ある出来事が別の出来事を引き起こしたとは言っていません。一つの例から法則を作っているのです。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "No chain of disasters here. Just one break-in, stretched over every thief alive."
    new "破滅の連鎖はありません。一度の侵入を、全泥棒に広げているだけです。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "Nobody is offering two doors. Count how many thieves her rule is built on."
    new "誰も二つの扉を示していません。彼女の法則が何人の泥棒に基づくか数えなさい。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "She isn't attacking anyone. She's turning one burglar into all of them."
    new "誰も攻撃していません。一人の泥棒を全員にしているのです。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "She isn't excusing herself with Marisa's sins. She's using Marisa as a sample of one."
    new "魔理沙の罪を言い訳にしているのではありません。魔理沙をたった一つの標本にしているのです。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "No famous name here. Just one memory doing the work of a survey."
    new "偉い人の名前は出てきません。一つの記憶に調査の代わりをさせているだけです。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "Her conclusion isn't hiding in her reason. Her reason is simply far too small."
    new "結論が理由に隠れているのではありません。理由が小さすぎるのです。"

    # game/case06.rpy:17
    old "That doesn't show how this thief got in. Find out which way they came."
    new "それではこの泥棒の侵入経路はわかりません。どこから来たかを調べなさい。"

